er use.</p></details><details class=\"uc-faq\"><summary>What AI model powers Qwen2.5 7B Instruct?</summary><p>Qwen2.5 7B Instruct runs open-source AI models including Qwen 2.5, FLUX and Whisper. We update to newer models as they ship.</p></details><details class=\"uc-faq\"><summary>Can I use Qwen2.5 7B Instruct on my phone?</summary><p>Yes. Qwen2.5 7B Instruct works in any mobile browser, and the layout adapts to your screen size.</p></details><details class=\"uc-faq\"><summary>How do I get more tokens?</summary><p>Sign up for a free account to get 5,000 tokens/day, double the anonymous limit. Or buy token packs starting at $5 for 200,000 tokens. See /pricing/ for all options.</p></details><details class=\"uc-faq\"><summary>Can I save and share my results?</summary><p>Yes. After you generate content, you can download it, copy it, or share it via a unique link. Signed-in users can also view their generation history.</p></details></div></div></aside></div></div><section class=\"uc-seo\"><div class=\"uc-seo-inner\"><h1>Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- --> — Free AI Chat on Rewind.ai</h1><p>Chat with <!-- -->Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- --> for free — no signup, no credit card. <!-- -->Qwen<!-- -->&#x27;s <!-- -->Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- --> runs in your browser on Rewind.ai, with pay-as-you-go tokens and full API access.</p><h2>What is <!-- -->Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- -->?</h2><p>Qwen2.5 7B is the latest series of Qwen large language models. Qwen2.5 brings the following improvements upon Qwen2: - Significantly more knowledge and has greatly improved capabilities in coding and.</p><h2>How does <!-- -->Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- --> work?</h2><p>Type your message in the box above and <!-- -->Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- --> replies instantly — no setup required. Your chat history is saved locally in your browser; sign up free to sync it across devices and get an extra 10,000 tokens. You can switch between <!-- -->Qwen2.5 7B Instruct<!-- --> and other models at any time from the picker at the to