\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. You get 2,500 free tokens per day to use AI Chat and every other tool on Rewind.ai. A free account raises that to 5,000 tokens/day. You can buy more starting at $1.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How does AI Chat work?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"AI Chat runs open-source AI models on our GPU servers. Send your request and the result comes back in seconds.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do I need to sign up to use AI Chat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"No. You can use AI Chat right away without signing up. A free account doubles your daily usage to 5,000 tokens and saves your history.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What are the daily limits for AI Chat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Anonymous users get 2,500 tokens/day. Free accounts get 5,000 tokens/day. Tokens reset every 24 hours. Each generation costs ~100-5,000 tokens depending on the operation.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Is my data safe when using AI Chat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Your data is processed on our servers and isn't stored permanently unless you choose to save it. We don't sell or share it.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I use AI Chat for commercial purposes?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Content from AI Chat is yours to use for personal or commercial work. The AI models we run are commercially licensed.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How does AI Chat compare to paid alternatives?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"AI Chat matches the quality of paid services because it runs the latest open-source AI models. The difference is you don't pay per use.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What AI model powers AI Chat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"AI Chat runs open-source AI models including Qwen 2.5, FLUX and Whisper. We update to newer models as they ship.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I use AI Chat on my phone?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. AI Chat works in any mobile browser, and the layout adapts to your screen size.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I get more tokens?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Sign up for a free account to get 5,000 tokens/day, double the anonymous limit. Or buy token packs starting at $5 for 200,000 tokens. See /pricing/ for all options.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I save and share my results?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. After you generate content, you can download it, copy it, or share it via a unique link. Signed-in users can also view their generation history.\\\"}}]}]}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3e\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"free-page-chat\\\",\\\"strategy\\\":\\\"afterInteractive\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"(function(){try{localStorage.setItem(\\\\\\\"free_page\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"chat\\\\\\\");}catch(e){}})();\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"jsonld-chat-1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$42\\\"}}],\\\"$L43\\\",\\\"$L44\\\"],[\\\"$L45\\\",\\\"$L46\\\"],\\\"$L47\\\"]}]\\n48:[]\\n20:\\\"$W48\\\"\\n21:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L49\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L4a\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":