se Qwen2.5 7B Instruct right away without signing up. A free account doubles your daily usage to 5,000 tokens and saves your history.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"uc-faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"What are the daily limits for Qwen2.5 7B Instruct?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Anonymous users get 2,500 tokens/day. Free accounts get 5,000 tokens/day. Tokens reset every 24 hours. Each generation costs ~100-5,000 tokens depending on the operation.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"uc-faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"Is my data safe when using Qwen2.5 7B Instruct?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your data is processed on our servers and isn't stored permanently unless you choose to save it. We don't sell or share it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"uc-faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"Can I use Qwen2.5 7B Instruct for commercial purposes?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Yes. Content from Qwen2.5 7B Instruct is yours to use for personal or commercial work. The AI models we run are commercially licensed.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"uc-faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"How does Qwen2.5 7B Instruct compare to paid alternatives?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Qwen2.5 7B Instruct matches the quality of paid services because it runs the latest open-source AI models. The difference is you don't pay per use.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"uc-faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"What AI model powers Qwen2.5 7B Instruct?\"}],\"$L11\"]}],\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\"]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"uc-seo\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"uc-seo-inner\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":[\"Qwen2.5 7B Instruct\",\" — Free AI Chat on Rewind.ai\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Chat with \",