ted\",extras:\"Shared balance, per-member daily/weekly/monthly limits, priority processing, My AI handles (per-handle cost)\",href:r.CHECKOUT_URLS.enterprise},{plan:\"Enterprise+\",price:\"$2,499/mo\",tokens:\"400M/mo per team\",team:\"Unlimited\",extras:\"Shared balance, per-member daily/weekly/monthly limits, priority processing, account manager\",href:r.CHECKOUT_URLS.enterprise_plus},{plan:\"Scale\",price:\"$4,999/mo\",tokens:\"1B/mo per team\",team:\"Unlimited\",extras:\"Shared balance, per-member daily/weekly/monthly limits, priority processing, account manager, SLA\",href:r.CHECKOUT_URLS.scale}],b=[{q:\"Can I cancel my subscription?\",a:\"Yes, you can cancel your subscription anytime. You keep your tokens until the end of the paid period.\"},{q:\"What happens when I run out?\",a:\"You never lose access: the free daily pool (5,000 tokens) keeps working on every plan. You can also top up with a one-time pack.\"},{q:\"How do payments work?\",a:\"Checkout is handled by Stripe (cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, PayPal). The purchase is linked to your current balance automatically — no extra steps.\"},{q:\"How many tools are available?\",a:\"Over 400 AI tools across 18 categories, covering chat, image, video, voice, music, writing, code, design, transcription and translation. We add new ones regularly.\"},{q:\"How does Rewind.ai compare to ChatGPT, Midjourney, etc.?\",a:\"We run open-source models like Qwen 2.5 72B (comparable to GPT-4), FLUX (comparable to Midjourney), and Kokoro for TTS. The difference is that Rewind.ai is free, has no hidden costs, and puts 400+ tools in one place.\"},{q:\"Can I use Rewind.ai on mobile?\",a:\"Yes. It works in any mobile browser on phone, tablet, or desktop, with no app to install.\"},{q:\"How does token sharing work on team plans?\",a:\"On Business and higher tiers, the token pool belongs to the team owner's subscription. Every member draws from that shared pool using their own configured spend order (personal balance first, then whichever team they belong to). Owners can set per-member limits on a daily, weekly or monthly basis, and members can draw from their own personal balance in parallel. No manual team selection is required — the platform follows each member's saved spend order automatically and splits a request across multiple wallets when one runs low.\"}],x=a.PLANS.filter(e=>\"Free\"!==e.name),y=`\n.pricing-redesign .plans-row{gap:18px;margin-top:40px}\n.pricing-redesign .plan-cell{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;max-width:360px}\n.pricing-redesign .value-box{background:var(--primary-bg);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:12px}\n.pricing-redesign .value-box .v-main{font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--primary-hover)}\n.pricing-redesign .value-box .v-alt{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px}\nhtml.dark .pricing-redesign .value-box{border-color:var(--border)}\nhtml.dark .pricing-redesign .plan-recommended{border-color:var(--primary) !important}\nhtml.dark .pricing-redesign .neat-table tbody tr:hover{background:var(--primary-bg-hover)}\nhtml.dark .pricing-redesign .card:not(.plan-recommended):hover{border-color:var(--border) !important}\n.pricing-redesign .plan-badge{position:absolute;top:-12px;right:16px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 12px;white-space:nowrap}\n.pricing-redesign .more-section{background:var(--bg-surface)}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table-wrap{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-card)}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table th{font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;color:var(--text-muted);text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;background:var(--bg-surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table td{padding:16px 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:middle}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table th:nth-child(3),.pricing-redesign .neat-table td:nth-child(3){padding-left:28px;padding-right:28px;white-space:nowrap}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table th:last-child,.pricing-redesign .neat-table td:last-child{text-align:right}\n.pricing-redesign .pack-mobile-meta{display:none}\n.pricing-redesign .team-mobile-meta{display:none}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table tbody tr:first-child td{border-top:0}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table tbody tr{transition:background .15s ease}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table tbody tr:hover{background:var(--primary-bg)}\n.pricing-redesign .neat-table .btn{min-width:112px;height:42px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.pricing-redesign .plan-cta{height:42px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.pricing-redesign .tab-btn{border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-card);color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:600;height:36px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}\n.pricing-redesign .tab-btn.active{border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-hover);background:var(--primary-bg)}\n.pricing-redesign .faq{max-width:820px;background:transparent}\n.pricing-redesign .faq-item{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;padding:0 16px;background:var(--bg-card)}\n.pricing-redesign .faq-item summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:13px 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\n.pricing-redesign .faq-item summary::after{content:\"+\";color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.1rem}\n.pricing-redesign .faq-item[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}\n.pricing-redesign{interpolate-size:allow-keywords}\n.pricing-redesign .faq-item::details-content{height:0;overflow:hidden;content-visibility:hidden;transition:height .28s ease,content-visibility .28s allow-discrete}\n.pricing-redesign .faq-item[open]::details-content{height:auto;content-visibility:visible}\n.pricing-redesign .free-line{max-width:820px;background:var(--bg-surface);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px}\n@media(max-width:860px){\n  .pricing-redesign .plan-cell{flex:0 0 100%;max-width:100%}\n  .pricing-redesign .plan-pro-col{order:-1}\n  /* 2. wider page side padding — on the inner containers (the root wrapper has\n     none, so the full-width grey section still spans edge-to-edge) */\n  .pricing-redesign .container{padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}\n  /* 1. full-width tabs, 44px tall, 16px text */\n  .pricing-redesign .tab-btn{flex:1 1 0;height:44px;font-size:16px;justify-content:center}\n  /* 3. tighter card body padding */\n  .pricing-redesign .card-body{padding:18px !important}\n  /* 4. card subheadings (green box headline) 16px */\n  .pricing-redesign .value-box .v-main{font-size:16px}\n  /* 5. card text (bullets + green box alt) 16px */\n  .pricing-redesign .value-box .v-alt{font-size:16px}\n  .pricing-redesign .plan-cell ul{font-size:16px}\n  /* 6. card CTA buttons 42px tall, solid green + semibold on mobile */\n  .pricing-redesign .plan-cta{height:42px;font-weight:600;background:var(--primary) !important;border-color:var(--primary) !important;color:#fff !important}\n  /* smaller gap above the green value box */\n  .pricing-redesign .value-box{margin-top:4px}\n  /* annual note: to the right of the price, 16px */\n  .pricing-redesign .price-wrap{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;column-gap:10px}\n  .pricing-redesign .annual-note{font-size:16px;min-height:0}\n  /* packs: collapse to Pack (name + price \\xb7 tokens) and the Buy button */\n  .pricing-redesign .pack-price-col,.pricing-redesign .pack-tokens-col{display:none}\n  .pricing-redesign .pack-mobile-meta{display:block;font-weight:400;margin-top:2px}\n  /* teams: collapse to Plan (name + price \\xb7 tokens) and the Choose button */\n  .pricing-redesign .team-price-col,.pricing-redesign .team-tokens-col,.pricing-redesign .team-extras-col{display:none}\n  .pricing-redesign .